<p>Calibre's Content Server stands out because it uses your existing Calibre library — no separate database, no double-importing, no format conflicts. If you already manage your ebooks with Calibre (and our <a href="/blog/calibre-9-11-annotations-html-export-2026/">Calibre 9.11 Guide</a> shows why you should), the Content Server is a natural extension.</p>

